title: vadd.f32 with a quiet NaN operand returns the default NaN, not the operand (FPSCR.DN = 1 on iOS)
ref: A2.7 FPProcessNaNs(), FPProcessNaN(): with FPSCR.DN = 1 the result is FPDefaultNaN() = 0x7FC00000; iOS runs with FPSCR = 0x03000000 (ADR 0022)

[code]
30ee201a    vadd.f32 s2, s0, s1
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0xFFC00123
s1 = f32:1.0

[out]
s2 = 0x7FC00000
